{"id":"5993","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5993_main_cumulonimbus-capillatus-praecipitatio-incus-mamma_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这是浓密的云，垂直厚度相当大。它是低空积状云，因为它有接近地面的近乎<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">水平的云底</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">清晰的轮廓</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">亮白色阳光照射部分</span>以及像花椰菜一样<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">凸起的上部</span>。</p>\n<p>云属确定为积雨云，因为其上部有清晰纤维状结构的卷云状部分（鬃云种），在这个实例中，该云呈<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状</span>（砧状附加特征）。</p>\n<p>在北侧砧状云的底面有大范围的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">悬球状</span>云区。在靠近单体处，悬球袋向下悬垂相当深。还有证据表明，在南侧砧状云底面在形成悬球状云。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中展积云单体</span>正转变为浓积云，而在照片前景中有非常破碎的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中展积云</span>单体，云底不规则。强风剪切了这些单体。照片中还有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎积云</span>碎片，同样还有通过积雨云部分扩散形成的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">高积云</span>块。</p>\n<p>在两处可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">上冲云顶</span>。该积雨云被确定为超单体，而且是产生破坏性大雹块的复合单体的一部分。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Antonio J. Galindo","location":"西班牙，昆卡，16630，莫塔德尔库埃尔沃","latitude":"纬度: 39° 30' 9'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 51' 23'' W","date":"16 June 2014 2056 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 6, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10.0","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10.0"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5993_syn_cumulonimbus-capillatus-praecipitatio-incus-mamma_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>西班牙上空的宽弱低压系统和在莫塔德尔库埃尔沃东南部的低压槽</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5993_upper_cumulonimbus-capillatus-praecipitatio-incus-mamma_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>在北西北方向130公里的探测显示出地表附近的超绝热层，此处至737 hPa（约2700米）的轻逆温都是不稳定的。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5993_sat_cumulonimbus-capillatus-praecipitatio-incus-mamma_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>EUMETSAT红外图像显示出积雨云单体区域，位置靠近东北到东，远离西南到南。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2013","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}